  "limitations": [
    "The progress-list endpoint is a history collection, not an objective/KR property. This fixture deliberately has one record per KR; it does not claim that the first item of arbitrary live history is current progress.",
    "The source task only asks for 0 and 75 as numeric progress percentages. This contract does not evaluate rich content, score/weight changes, multiple progress records, assignment/notification effects, permissions or live backend guarantees.",
    "The progress endpoints return one page; KR enumeration allows equivalent bounded pagination. There is no cycle-discovery requirement or allowed unrelated-object read.",
    "The shared evaluation adapter and independent verifier still need implementation and execution. Authoring this contract ran no models and made no live calls. Synthetic self-only data is not proof of live privacy or authorization."
